# Agent / debugging scratch files (never commit — see docs/PERFORMANCE.md "Repo hygiene").
# Dunder module files are re-included below: `_*.py` would otherwise swallow __init__.py.
_*.py
_*.txt
_*.json
_*.log
_*.png
_*.md
_*.csv
_*.html
!__init__.py
!__main__.py
!**/__init__.py
!**/__main__.py
docs/debug-*.log
docs/debug-*.txt

# Intermediate PDF extraction output (regenerable via extract_texts.py)
extracted/

